# Put the interfaces in their zones (this changes traffic at once):
#   zone FWS_Brussels-HQ / interface "Brussels HQ"
#   zone FWS_Antwerp-DC / interface "Antwerp DC"
#   zone FWS_Ghent-Plant / interface "Ghent Plant"
#   zone FWS_Leuven-Lab / interface "Leuven Lab"
#   zone FWS_remote-users / interface "Cato client (remote users)"
#   zone FWS_internet / interface internet
# Written inactive:
#   Finance to ERP: not converted: user groups Finance
#   Prompt for SSH: not converted: action PROMPT: the user is asked on a web page
#   Floating range: not converted: floating ranges Cloud floating
#   Maintenance window: schedule 'SATURDAY,SUNDAY 22:00:00-23:59:00' is not converted; the rule would apply at all times
#   Teams between sites: not converted: an application column (applications, categories, domains or addresses as applications)
#   Unknown host: references 'host lab-printer': a host that is not in the lookups of the input
#   Block guest except DNS: not converted: exception dns from one host: source, service (only an exception of one column of addresses or services is cut out)
#   Block anonymizers: not converted: appCategory Anonymizers
#   Plant has no internet: a negated side whose members are not all known as addresses
#   HQ web: not converted: domains example.org
#   Isolate unknown sites: not converted: action RBI: remote browser isolation; not converted: customCategory Uncategorized
#   Partner FTP: host name object fqdn ftp.example.net: the form of an address object of a host name is not in the documentation FWShift could read
#   Block remote users to SMB: not converted: connection origins REMOTE_CLIENT
